      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9613565" metaid="metaid_17" name="PRKAA2 dissociate from p-PLINs:HSPA8" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Once phosphorylated, PLINs are believed to dissociate from PRKAA2 and translocate to the cytosol (S Kaushik et al. 2015, S Kaushik et al. 2016). The precise dissociation mechanism of Plins is unclear. The experiments showing this finding were performed in mouse models.</p>
        </notes>
